  "bodyHash": "e012cd62fc6e7335",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VZ1V6jz.png\" alt=\"模組展示\" width=\"658\" height=\"344\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>MCreator x CurseForge ModJam 2024 參賽作品</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>需要安裝 GeckoLib！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1021581/description_16b1366a-847d-442c-82e7-c1fed2cc39d2.png\" alt=\"GeckoLib 提醒\" width=\"202\" height=\"73\"></strong></span></a><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1890f2e6-1611-451f-88e4-bb36c0253a3a.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"642\" height=\"10\"><br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>本模組<strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">不建議</span></strong>在大型公開伺服器上使用，這是因為</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">「墨池競技場」活動的運作機制，同一時間只能進行單一活動。<br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">但</span></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">與朋友遊玩的私人伺服器則完全沒問題！<br>如果你發現任何錯誤，請在模組頁面留言回報！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1890f2e6-1611-451f-88e4-bb36c0253a3a.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"642\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本模組新增了兩種結構、數個物品與生物。</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>共有八種新敵人，其中包含一隻首領。以下介紹幾種：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>斑點怪（Splotch）</strong>：基礎敵人，傷害極低。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c979eacc-48eb-42c5-8f85-42ce5543a7a0.png\" alt=\"斑點怪\" width=\"250\" height=\"170\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>變異墨靈（Morphink）</strong>：會射擊危險彈頭；在它變身成更強的敵人前將其擊殺。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2f8ee81c-a85a-46c0-9396-7905696d7f82.png\" alt=\"變異墨靈\" width=\"250\" height=\"249\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1890f2e6-1611-451f-88e4-bb36c0253a3a.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"642\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<h3><strong>建築結構：</strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>墨鎮遺跡（又稱墨池競技場）</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"font-weight:400;color:#999\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1021581/description_b4ad419a-b1ed-4cf2-b687-3dac264da8a8.png\" alt=\"墨池遺跡\" width=\"388\" height=\"218\"></p>\n<h3>破壞中間的水晶球將啟動墨池軍勢活動</h3>\n<h3>迎擊一波波敵人，最終面對首領。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>擊敗首領後將獲得靈魂核心；</strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>用它來製作全新的武器吧！</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>-------- 靈魂斬擊者 --------</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c15d28d6-4257-4962-b197-621c3a83695d.png\" alt=\"靈魂斬擊者\" width=\"170\" height=\"151\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>滑鼠左鍵：發射穿透斬擊，僅在身旁無生物時可發動。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>-------- 染墨法典 --------</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5d7a96d1-73d6-4e00-95a2-6005d4c2b2c5.png\" alt=\"染墨法典\" width=\"182\" height=\"123\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>按住滑鼠右鍵：蓄力攻擊，將周圍所有生物擊飛。</li>\n<li>滑鼠左鍵：施放墨水法術。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>-------- 靈魂畫筆 --------</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1021581/description_265c5cf3-a0e0-4036-9971-72257f571a7d.png\" alt=\"靈魂畫筆\" width=\"128\" height=\"165\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>滑鼠右鍵：在地面繪製靈魂符文；當生物踩過時會造成傷害並賦予標記效果。</li>\n<li>滑鼠左鍵：在地面繪製墨水符文；當生物踩過時會引爆周圍所有標記生物。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h3><strong>古代墨之神殿</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3><strong>外觀</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1021581/description_bf1ae73e-402c-4d9c-8c96-df6fef544073.png\" alt=\"古代墨之神殿外觀\" width=\"382\" height=\"215\"></p>\n<h3><strong>內部</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1021581/description_85853f36-3694-47f0-9f0b-85e098c86ef1.png\" alt=\"古代墨之神殿內部\" width=\"382\" height=\"215\"></p>\n<p>此神殿內有多重陷阱，請小心行事！</p>\n<h3><strong>組合密碼鎖；在神殿內尋找密碼。</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1021581/description_ef6a810a-c222-46bf-911a-d0c307223bd5.png\" alt=\"墨之神殿謎題\" width=\"382\" height=\"215\"></p>\n<h3><strong>破解密碼後，你將獲得獎勵：靈魂印記；</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>-------- 靈魂印記 --------</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1021581/description_f78ff2f7-1b64-48a9-9ea6-d714dce6ce7e.png\" alt=\"靈魂印記\" width=\"152\" height=\"210\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>當你死亡時，改為恢復至一半生命值。</li>\n<li>具有較長的冷卻時間。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h3><strong>所有物品、方塊與生物列表。</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>-------- 物品與方塊 --------</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1021581/description_1312debf-f40a-4640-b731-53df90b78987.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"171\"></p>\n<p><strong>-------- 生物 --------</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1021581/description_24d3fc6d-dbbe-4fdf-ab1e-6031201fded1.png\" alt=\"所有生物\" width=\"387\" height=\"180\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>由左至右：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>斑點怪（Splotch）</li>\n<li>靈魂觸手（Soul Tendril）</li>\n<li>墨之蠻兵（Ink Brute）</li>\n<li>靈魂幽靈（Soul Specter）</li>\n<li>變異墨靈（Morphink）</li>\n<li>墨蟲（Ink Worm）</li>\n<li>墨之泰坦（Ink Titan）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>親自體驗本模組，探索所有內容吧！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
